# solution.md
$ mkdir -p /tmp/old && tar -xzf /work/old-backup.tgz -C /tmp/old work/sites/blog/posts/hello.md && cp /tmp/old/work/sites/blog/posts/hello.md /work/sites/blog/posts/hello.md

[exit 0]

